Article 2 (Applicability to inclusion in the minimum required period for promotion)
The amended provisions of Article 39(2)1c shall also apply to the period of leave of absence taken by a civilian military employee in general service before the enforcement of this Decree for pregnancy, childbirth, or childrearing.
Article 3 (Applicability to restrictions on appointment by promotion)
(1) The amended provisions of Article 40(1)1 shall also apply to persons who, at the time of enforcement of this Decree, are under request for disciplinary action, request for disciplinary resolution, on leave of absence, or under probationary appointment.
(2) The amended provisions of Article 40(1)2 shall also apply to persons who, at the time of enforcement of this Decree, are subject to restrictions on appointment by promotion due to disciplinary actions imposed for sexual violence, sexual harassment, or prostitution.
Article 4 (Applicability to dismissal due to disability)
