ADDENDA <Presidential Decree No. 33835, Oct. 31, 2023>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Decree shall enter into force on January 1, 2025.
Article 2 (Pilot operation of the competency evaluation system)
(1) The Minister of National Defense may pilot the competency evaluation referred to in the amended provisions of Article 42-2 before the enforcement of this Decree to ensure the smooth implementation of the competency evaluation system, and may entrust such pilot operation to the Minister of Personnel Management.
(2) Matters necessary for the pilot operation of the competency evaluation, other than those prescribed in paragraph (1), shall be determined by the Minister of National Defense.
Article 3 (Transitional measures concerning implementation and utilization of competency evaluation)
A person who has passed the competency evaluation conducted as a pilot operation pursuant to Article 2 of the Addenda before the enforcement of this Decree shall be deemed to have passed the competency evaluation under the amended provisions of Article 42-2.

